#1.Basic Conformer Information: name, pka, em, rxn.
#23456789A123456789B123456789C
#2.Structure Connectivity
#23456789A123456789B123456789C123456789D123456789E123456789F123456789G123456789H123456789I
#23456789A123456789B123456789C123456789D123456789E123456789F123456789G123456789H123456789I
